	<section_number>46.2-899</section_number>
	<catch_line>Article applies to accidents on private or public property</catch_line>
	<text>
		The provisions of this article shall apply irrespective of whether such accident occurs on the public streets or highways or on private property.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 46-189; 1958, c. 541, § 46.1-176; 1970, c. 59; 1977, c. 267; 1982, c. 503; 1984, c. 780; 1989, c. 727.</history>
